    example: "A neighbourhood running coach, an original adult, not a famous athlete. Week one is two reels and one photo. Monday is 22 seconds. In the first three seconds the same face is in the usual chair, and the voice says Rest day is still training. One stretch follows. Thursday's Life photo reuses that face and that jacket on a quiet street. A second face was rejected. The realistic face and voice are labeled as AI before the first share.",
    bridge: "Scro locks the face, changes clothes only, and reuses that host for Life photos. Approve the stills before the talk. Label a realistic face or voice as AI.",
    checks: ["Face, voice, and clothes were decided first.", "You posted twice before a new look.", "The profile is labeled if the person is photoreal."],
