    bridge: "Scro locks the face, changes clothes only, and uses that identity for Life photos. Approve each still against the first before you render or post. Label a realistic face or voice as AI. Open post one beside the new still on a phone and check the eyes, the jaw, and the ear. A Life photo that ignores the lock is rejected even when the jacket matches. Clothes can change next week. The head stays for the month.",
